<!--
  Maia's one icon set: Lucide (https://lucide.dev, ISC licence, lucide-static 0.460.0), on its 24-unit grid. Each key is
  named for what it means in Maia (docs/design/README.md, Icons and the logo). Draw them with the Icon control, which
  strokes them at 1.8 with round ends, in one colour: <controls:Icon Data="{StaticResource IconLeaf}" ... />.
  A new icon comes from Lucide too, its SVG elements written as one path of M, L, C and Z only: Android's path reader
  draws some of Lucide's arcs wrongly or not at all (the diagnostics and privacy icons came out blank), so arcs,
  circles and rectangles become cubic curves and lines. A test keeps arcs out.
-->
